{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"route","t":2902.128764,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":9402.546187,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":9880.01181,"text":"1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensande in die Liste der gefährdeten Welterbestätten aufgenommen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":10537.346592999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":10539.24425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10540.324014999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":10541.627147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10543.477341999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":10543.769882,"samples":9752,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"route","t":13701.254945,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":19015.510280000002,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19510.600272,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film National Treasure gesehen haben, glauben Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte geschrieben stand. "},{"kind":"audio","t":20266.989348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20268.254072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20269.902323000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":20271.734911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20273.704857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20275.392768,"samples":32600,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1130},{"kind":"route","t":21001.953063,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":26876.694989,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27297.450408,"text":"Kinder kommen aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien, die von Vernachlässigung bis hin zu Missbrauch reichen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":27906.717777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27908.093688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27909.917063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27911.738805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27912.565249,"samples":17164,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"route","t":27912.69198,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":30058.392108,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30224.513885,"text":"und sogar bis hin zu Erpressung. "},{"kind":"audio","t":30396.718549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30396.95835,"samples":5684,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"route","t":32000.598003,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":41125.026721,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41782.275645,"text":"Das Chocamo-Tal, Chiles bedeutendstes Klettergebiet, bekannt als das Yosemite Südamerikas, mit einer Vielzahl an Granit-Big-Walls und Felsklettern. "},{"kind":"audio","t":42586.000494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42587.309745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42588.898877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42590.804946000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":42592.519857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":42594.324253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42594.475822,"samples":4290,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"route","t":42801.775352000004,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":46504.33656,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46860.045326,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen wissenschaftlichen Fragen, einschließlich der Physiologie, wurden akzeptiert. "},{"kind":"audio","t":47472.761396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47474.060963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47475.837787000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47477.641722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47478.556259000005,"samples":19393,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"route","t":48501.770348,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"text","t":52969.307016,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie wachsam. "},{"kind":"audio","t":53379.373625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53380.859692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53382.576577,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":53382.731129,"samples":55,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54317.365152,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54675.755174,"text":"Steile Steigungen, schmale Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":55028.918478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55030.456183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55031.39077,"samples":20842,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"route","t":58602.32923,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":67705.291795,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68398.300347,"text":"Die Präsenz des wahren unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist ebenfalls eine einzigartige Komponente eines virtuellen Teams. "},{"kind":"audio","t":69444.31057999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69445.597126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69447.37167699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69449.05710399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69450.91283799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":69452.60682799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":69454.449652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69456.264023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69456.74715,"samples":11479,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"route","t":69456.88964499999,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":73007.066102,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73404.221907,"text":"Nachdem der Unfall passiert war, wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus transportiert, verstarb jedoch kurz darauf. "},{"kind":"audio","t":73924.861809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73925.914794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73927.889486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":73929.77863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73929.99763,"samples":6854,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"route","t":75001.36547199999,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":82818.17192099999,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83150.08116199999,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren enthalten Mandeln, Haselnüsse und andere Schalenfrüchte. Beliebte Kuchen passen oft besonders gut zu einer Tasse starkem Kaffee. "},{"kind":"audio","t":83739.79355599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83741.72974,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":83742.98119399999,"samples":28922,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":83744.806562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83746.629286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83748.13315899999,"samples":27250,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"route","t":84901.16245399999,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":90184.38114099999,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90701.15416199999,"text":"Es versteht sich von selbst, dass es für Sie einfacher sein wird, Portugiesisch zu lernen, wenn Sie eine romanische Sprache beherrschen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":91358.195343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91359.753258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91361.779027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91363.69769599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91365.53772499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":91365.630385,"samples":557,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":93601.600293,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":97872.337065,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98320.08501499999,"text":"Die Ton- und Lichtshow an den Pyramiden ist für Kinder eine der interessantesten Attraktionen in der Gegend. "},{"kind":"audio","t":98936.42225599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98938.260102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98939.995965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98941.975675,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98942.29834099999,"samples":9919,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"route","t":99500.65972299999,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":103792.53215,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104110.822812,"text":"Der Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten. "},{"kind":"audio","t":104667.382642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104667.94664099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104669.665499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104671.46204299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":104671.607232,"samples":1281,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":104701.658306,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":106581.310432,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106816.854308,"text":"und die Wechselwirkungen, die sie untereinander eingehen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":107086.172423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107087.587854,"samples":31040,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"route","t":107801.32022,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":114898.164425,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":115258.75579,"text":"Australiens Mitchell Gowrie belegte im Super-G der Männer den 11. Platz. "},{"kind":"audio","t":115681.934306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115683.14531899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115684.60788099999,"samples":28086,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":115685.29133899999,"samples":13095,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":480},{"kind":"route","t":115685.372962,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":121692.06597,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122132.812811,"text":"Der Teilnehmer Ulrich Joklin belegte im Super-G der Männer in der Kategorie Sitzen den 16. Platz. "},{"kind":"audio","t":122698.76406799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122700.04065899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122701.79360799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122703.661069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":122703.80496499999,"samples":445,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":122704.174111,"samples":12817,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":450},{"kind":"route","t":123301.032702,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":128668.499163,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought the"},{"kind":"text","t":129128.83313799999,"text":"Wie erwähnt, legen unabhängige Studien nahe, dass ein nepalesisches UN-Friedenseinsatzbattalion unwissentlich das "},{"kind":"audio","t":129824.548064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129825.91443099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129827.61727399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129829.39467899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129831.05485799999,"samples":31096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"route","t":130801.26371,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":136568.123495,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136962.01095999999,"text":"Kurz nach Ausbruch der Feindseligkeiten leitete Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland ein. "},{"kind":"audio","t":137494.429431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137495.806785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137497.507755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137499.26869599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137499.417349,"samples":2953,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":140602.176736,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"text","t":145953.288489,"text":"Es griff zudem alles an, was ins Wasser gelangte. "},{"kind":"audio","t":146259.037262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146260.537801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146260.811593,"samples":8582,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":146421.273411,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146751.632369,"text":"Selbst ein riesiger Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex wäre ihm nicht gewachsen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":147147.964824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147149.233454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147150.567362,"samples":28086,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"route","t":149101.06584,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":155093.440344,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155454.609409,"text":"Der Einsatz von Videoaufzeichnungen hat zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen bei der Interpretation von Mikroexpressionen geführt. "},{"kind":"audio","t":156046.14548799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156048.292169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156049.587379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156051.385816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156052.331319,"samples":17442,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"route","t":156052.519012,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":159379.940264,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159662.694034,"text":"Gesichtsbewegungen, die nur wenige Millisekunden dauern. "},{"kind":"audio","t":159976.10966699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159977.525188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159977.947283,"samples":11647,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"route","t":161900.826988,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":167485.886695,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167895.062032,"text":"Die Bekanntgabe erfolgte, nachdem Trump ein Telefonat mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan geführt hatte. "},{"kind":"audio","t":168534.05991399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168535.322975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168537.12396599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168539.104477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168540.41527,"samples":29702,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"route","t":170001.499991,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":175192.159281,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175569.718848,"text":"Dies sind manchmal überfüllte Familienstrände mit einer guten Auswahl an Geschäften entlang der Küste. "},{"kind":"audio","t":176074.131703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176075.55713899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176077.323338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":176078.895224,"samples":28476,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1140},{"kind":"route","t":176100.923112,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":177147.862663,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177320.979971,"text":"Ich will einfach nur in Sicherheit kommen. "},{"kind":"audio","t":177498.735811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177499.104375,"samples":10978,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"route","t":179501.321654,"type":"route","src":"en"},{"kind":"input","t":188677.324644,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":189101.19682399998,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder mit Frankreich verbunden und als luxuriöse Strandresorts bekannt. "},{"kind":"audio","t":189788.522362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189789.69191199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":189791.46159599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189793.334695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189795.177669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189795.582329,"samples":11702,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"close","t":199802.052532,"code":1005}]}